& [CommissionPreconditions]
  + require signed exact executable wrapper and native identities selected-version generated schemas closed environment grammar sandbox and Windows setup identity method-closed carrier prepared root identities recovery owner process budgets and independent observer
  + rehash every immutable input immediately before fixture admission and again immediately before process launch
  + require provider-unavailable evidence to remain independently valid and forbid credentials model turn MCP browser connector web search remote transport or provider fallback
  + any missing drifted unavailable or ambiguous precondition produces NotRun with run_count zero and no synthetic transcript

& [EvidenceBundle]
  + one immutable commission binds UUID profile predecessor commit executable schema environment sandbox carrier root fixture observer process budget and recovery-owner digests
  + one pre-state record binds exact root roles pairwise relations strongest supplied identities membership bytes metadata and canary digests
  + one redacted protocol transcript binds ordered initialize initialized configuration command/exec response error notification and terminal frames by raw-byte digest without secrets
  + one process account binds direct child and descendant identities start termination wait exit timeout byte event late-output and interruption state
  + one sandbox account binds requested returned and independently observed allowed-read denied-read denied-write and local-only network-refusal coordinates
  + one post-state record repeats all pre-state coordinates and records exact equality or authorized disposable-state delta without performing cleanup
  + one result is either VerifiedPreflightObservation or NotRun and can never represent B2 mutation acceptance rollback cleanup publication or activation
  + one content-addressed manifest binds all artifacts producer executable source and independent verifier identities

& [IndependentVerification]
  + the verifier accepts only raw bundle paths and commission digest and does not invoke the producer executable provider model sandbox or cleanup
  + strict decoding rejects unknown fields duplicate keys duplicate trial coordinates missing frames reordered ids nonterminal descendants oversized values path overlap redaction failure and any digest mismatch
  + it recomputes transcript frame digests process totals pre/post canary equality root relation matrix environment name-value digests schema identity and result disposition
  + it requires protocol refusal and independent unchanged host state for every denied effect coordinate
  + it refuses VerifiedPreflightObservation when run_count is not exactly one or when provider_contacted registration_count model_turn_count MCP_call_count external_network_count or mutation_count is nonzero
  + it accepts NotRun only with run_count zero empty transcript and one exact machine-readable refusal cause bound to the failed precondition

& [PublicationAndRecovery]
  + evidence writing occurs only after the observed child and all descendants are terminal and only under a separate evidence-producer commission
  + cleanup remains a later recovery-owner action after independent verification and publication decision and is never performed by B1 or its verifier
  + verifier failure quarantines the prepared roots and evidence bundle for operator review without retry substitution or deletion
  + publication may claim only provider-free read-only preflight correspondence and cannot activate B2 through B5 or SWA-05

& [GapDelta]
  + G07 changes from unspecified live evidence to exact preconditions bundle artifacts independent recomputation NotRun zero-run behavior quarantine and publication boundaries
  + G07 remains unresolved for exact selected input digests concrete fixture coordinates verifier type and path implementation and commissioned live run
  + G01 and G02 exact selection and schema remain primary blockers while G03 through G06 retain narrowed_not_closed residuals

& [StopRules]
  + do not run a process create a fixture write an evidence bundle contact a provider synthesize a transcript clean roots or publish a live result under this source
  + do not treat existing provider-independent or provider-unavailable verifier success as B1 live evidence
  + do not retry an unavailable or failed precondition into a synthetic success

